{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19910","headline":"秋怀 五 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹风相戛语，幽闺暗中闻。\n鬼神满衰听，恍惚难自分。\n商叶堕乾雨，秋衣卧单云。\n病骨可剸物，酸呻亦成文。\n瘦攒如此枯，壮落随西曛。\n褭褭一线命，徒言系絪緼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}